Short:        UP-Term: source of the Unix tools
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     UPLOADER-ADDRESS-PLACEHOLDER (spotUP)
Type:         comm/term
Version:      @VERSION@
Replaces:     PLACEHOLDER (the Aminet path of an earlier upload, if there is one)
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     none (source archive)
Distribution: Aminet

The source that goes with UP-Term.lha: each Unix tool port as its upstream archive with
UP-Term's patches, recipes and build scripts, and the GNU coreutils 5.2.1 source tarball.
It is published next to UP-Term.lha (comm/term), as the GPL's section 3 allows equivalent
access to the source from the same place.

Licence: per package, see the licence files and SOURCES.txt inside; coreutils GPL v2.
